# JSON is often source, review evidence, or a reproducible workflow manifest in
# this project. Ignore only known generated/local JSON locations; a broad
# `*.json` rule used to hide the frontend package and TypeScript configuration.
output/**/*.json
downloads/**/*.json
cache/**/*.json
wordService/tmp/**/*.json
# Local workflow inputs and generated audit/run manifests. Their schemas are
# documented in the owning skills; they are not source code to add incidentally
# when a broad JSON ignore is removed.
data/
work/
bazi-ziwei-output/
